<p>So, that was neat.</p>
<p>Watching the build up to the events of Hello World, and then the aftermath was interesting. I personally found hatbot's dialogue, while at times hard to read, entertaining. Additionally, I liked the images used in this article, especially the electronics store advertisement used by hatbot in addenda 3.</p>
<p>If I had one complaint, it would be that I am in agreement with MrWrong, and that it would have been neat to see the final interview done in the AI avatar style. Maybe something to consider following the close of the contest.</p>
<p>+1</p>
<p>On a final note, I see you there, Anderson Robotics reference. Is the implication that they reverse engineered 1360 to create the new robotic body?</p>

